  "schema_id": "pm.card2.original_custody.v1",
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "claim_boundary": "Static stand-in for Storage's sealed write-time custody of DCN originals: the independent sealed lookup SP-1101 requires of finite fixtures. It is written on the writer side and read only by the composition in scripts/pm_card2_events.py (Card2OriginalOwner, install_frozen_recipes); a case under check never adds to it, and no case field (authentic, verified, a recipe name) selects a recipe. Native custody, authentication, durability and admission are NOT_RUN; DCN is prepared without admission and has one write-time recipe, card2@1; every original selects it only from its own sealed receipt. Batch 2 fix 1 negatives: operation-ambiguous originals have two receipts (recipe_ambiguous), operation-other-scope originals have only the receipt of the application-scope original at that event id (original_unavailable), and operation-other originals have none (original_unavailable).",
